event: thinking
data: {"id": "8bc12e34dde44bbc-thinking-layer-369", "run_id": "8bc12e34dde44bbc", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Pod 状态为 `Running` 但 `READY=0/1`。这符合 `NotReadyProbeFailed` 或 `ConfigError` 的特征（如探针失败或配置错误导致容器未就绪）。由于 `kubectl get` 没有显示详细的事件或 Reason，我需要检查 Pod 的详细描述或事件来区分是探针失败还是配置错误。\n\n让我获取 Pod 的详细事件以辅助判断异常类型。通常可以通过 `kubectl describe` 或 `kubectl get events` 查看。但工具中只有 `kubectl_get_by_name` (显示 labels) 和 `kubectl_get_by_kind_in_cluster`。`kubectl_get_by_name` 的摘要未显示事件信息。\n\n不过，根据 `Ready=0/1` 且 `STATUS=Running`，最可能的异常类型是 `pod-notready-probe-failed.md`。如果容器启动失败导致 Ready=0/1，通常会显示 CrashLoopBackOff 或 CreateContainerConfigE", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789093068292}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "8bc12e34dde44bbc-thinking-layer-370", "run_id": "8bc12e34dde44bbc", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "tool_start", "tool_name": "fetch_runbook", "content": null, "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789093068296}

event: thinking
data: {"id": "8bc12e34dde44bbc-thinking-layer-371", "run_id": "8bc12e34dde44bbc", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "fetch_runbook", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "<runbook>\n# Pod NotReadyProbeFailed / Running 但未 Ready\n\n> Pod异常类型: NotReadyProbeFailed | 典型状态: Running + READY 0/1 | 兼容分类: probe_health\n\n## 状态识别\n- Pod phase 通常为 `Running`，但 READY 为 `0/1` 或部分容器未 Ready\n", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789093068318}

