data: {"id": "8bc12e34dde44bbc-final", "run_id": "8bc12e34dde44bbc", "seq": 1293, "ts_ms": 1789093148204, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc` | NotReady | Pod NotReady (Readiness Probe failed: HTTP 503) |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503` | 直接症状，确认 Kubelet 检测到的就绪失败原因是 503 状态码 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.condition: ContainersReady=ContainersNotReady(app), Ready=ContainersNotReady(app)` | 确认 Pod 实际状态与探针结果一致，容器未就绪 |\n| 3 | Logging | elasticsearch | `dependency unavailable` (HTTP 503, path: `/work`) | 提供应用层日志，将 503 状态码归因于“依赖不可用”这一具体应用错误 |\n| 4 | Tracing | tempo | `http.response.status_code: 503`, `attributes.aiops.observed_mode: readiness_fail` | 确认探针请求链路返回 503，且被标记为探针失败模式 |\n| 5 | Tracing | deepflow | `dst_ip: 172.16.104.16` -> `response_code: 503` | 确认 Pod 自身 IP 的入站流量持续被拒绝，且与日志时间窗吻合 |\n| 6 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `resource_limit.memory: 96Mi` | 作为环境背景，确认资源限制配置情况 |\n\n日志中记录的 `dependency unavailable` 错误（fact-2880df2fde51 等）与 Tempo 追踪中记录的探针 503 响应（fact-b7f784fdb898）相互印证，明确指向应用代码在 `/work` 路径返回失败是由于内部依赖问题，而非网络连通性或资源耗尽问题。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n```text\nApplication dependency unavailable → Readiness probe /work returns HTTP 503 → Kubelet marks container unready → Pod enters NotReady state\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因为：**应用探针端点 `/work` 因依赖不可用（dependency unavailable）返回 HTTP 503 状态码**。\n\n*   **直接原因**：应用代码在探针检查时未能访问其依赖资源（证据编号 3、4、5）。\n*   **机制**：Kubelet 执行就绪探针（Readiness Probe）时，收到 HTTP 503 响应，判定容器不健康，从而导致 Pod 状态标记为 `ContainersNotReady`（证据编号 1、2）。\n*   **缺失事实**：当前证据无法确认导致“依赖不可用”的具体下游服务或资源名称（unknowns: Specific identity of the unavailable dependency）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 20.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 58.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc: 58.1s (Evidence 51.7s, RCA 6.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 87.658, "metrics": {"run_id": "8bc12e34dde44bbc", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 87.65814137458801, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "50%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 87658.14137458801, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 60009.06682014465, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 53512.62950897217, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 27056.706190109253}, "nodes